.ie \n(.g .ds Aq \(aq
.el .ds Aq '
.TH "skillastic audit" 1  "skillastic audit " 
.SH NAME
skillastic audit \- Audit project roots for missing or incomplete .skillastic workspaces
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBskillastic audit\fR [\fB\-\-root\fR] [\fB\-\-source\fR] [\fB\-\-infer\fR] [\fB\-\-model\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Audit project roots for missing or incomplete .skillastic workspaces
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-root\fR \fI<ROOT>\fR [default: .]
Directory to scan (defaults to the current directory)
.TP
\fB\-\-source\fR \fI<SOURCES>\fR
Additional project\-source directory; repeat for multiple sources
.TP
\fB\-\-infer\fR
Ask Groq to prioritize deterministic findings using bound context
.TP
\fB\-\-model\fR \fI<MODEL>\fR [default: llama\-3.1\-8b\-instant]
Groq model used for advisory prioritization
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
